sequenceDiagram
    participant U as You
    participant G as LangGraph (debug=True)
    participant M as Model node
    participant T as Tool node
    U->>G: invoke({"messages": [...]})
    G->>M: model step — printed
    M-->>G: tool call
    G->>T: tool step — printed
    T-->>G: tool result
    G->>M: model step — printed
    M-->>G: final answer
    G-->>U: result
